-[![test](https://github.com/aspose-pdf-foss/aspose-pdf-foss-for-go/actions/workflows/test.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/aspose-pdf-foss/aspose-pdf-foss-for-go/actions/workflows/test.yml)
