+
+- **For:** Developers using Go.
+- **Problem solved:** AcroForm field creation and editing. Annotation creation and manipulation (16 types). Text rendering and extraction. Markdown to PDF conversion.
+- **Verified capabilities:** AcroForm field creation and editing. Annotation creation and manipulation (16 types). Text rendering and extraction. Image embedding and rendering. Font embedding and subsetting. Markdown to PDF conversion. PDF to Markdown conversion.
+- **Verified formats:** PDF (ISO 32000-1 and ISO 32000-2). PNG. JPEG. GIF. BMP. Multi-page TIFF. SVG. Markdown.
+- **Runtime:** Go 1.24+
